    "detailed_description": "Dangerous demons have attacked the entire city and the city is in crisis.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nyou have accepted the mission to save the city<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a duelist with endless possibilities, you must fight against the evil demon army<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeing wrong with the demon's powerful attacks can put your life in danger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nwe have to find a way to survive in this crisis<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you defeat demons and gain experience points to level up, you can choose skills that will be randomly given to you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry to properly combine a total of 20 skills to create the best result<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictory or defeat can be determined by how you combine your skills, so you must choose carefully.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou may lose your life to the boss's powerful Chinese medicine, so you should use evasion techniques to avoid it",
